Keys:
PK = Primary Key
FK = Foreign Key
UQ = Unique Key
? = nullable

On delete:
[cascade]   = child deleted too
[set null]  = FK set to NULL
[no action] = delete blocked
◆ = owner (cascade)

Colors:
orange = planned



